      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-07T19:47:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I strongly feel clubbing the IPC part and the IMS Service\u0027s reporting of the features should not be in one module. If we want to keep them together, then I feel it would be great to refactor the methods to be able to understand the usage difference. Capabilities, features, and configs are quite confusing when used together, I believe :-)\n\nThat will be really helpful. Any ETA on the formal doc?",
